= Formulae for nerds =

=== VP Gain Formulas ===

* '''Initial Formula:'''  <big><math>0.01 \cdot 3^{\text{MineralLevel} - 1}</math></big>

* '''After Refine Node 1:'''  <big><math>0.01 \cdot (3 + Refine Node Level)^{\text{MineralLevel} - 1}</math></big>

You can also boost VP by buying relics 22 and 23 and polishing sword:

* Relic Formula: <big><math>(Initial Formula)\cdot Relic 22 ^{\text{Relic 23}}</math></big>

* Polished Sword: <big><math>(Initial Formula)\cdot (Polished Sword Level)</math></big>

=== Merging ===

* Merge Level cap increment: <big><math> 10 \cdot (Merge Level + 1) ^2 </math></big>
* Beyond Merge Level 101: <math>(10 \cdot (Merge Level + 1) ^ 2) ^ {(1+ \frac{MergeLevel-100}{100})}</math>

=== Base Effect Of Mineral Upgrades ===

* Mineral upgrade 1 effect:<math> UpgradeLevel+1</math>
* Mineral upgrade 2 effect: <math>UpgradeLevel+3</math> (caps at 9)
* Mineral upgrade 3 effect: <math>UpgradeLevel+3</math> (caps at 9)
* Mineral upgrade 4 effect:  <math>(2+{UpgradeLevel}/2)^{UpgradeLevel}</math>
* Mineral upgrade 5 effect: <math>1+{UpgradeLevel}/10</math>
* Mineral upgrade 6 effect: <math>1+{UpgradeLevel}/5</math>
* Mineral upgrade 7 effect: <math>2^{UpgradeLevel}</math>
* Mineral upgrade 8 effect: <math>1+{UpgradeLevel}/100</math>
* Mineral upgrade 9 effect: <math>1+ {UpgradeLevel}/100</math>
* Mineral upgrade 10 effect: <math>({UpgradeLevel}/10)%</math>
* Magnet upgrade 1 effect:<math>1+\text{upgradeLevel}/100</math>
* Magnet upgrade 2 effect:<math>(\text{upgradeLevel}/1000)%</math>
* Magnet upgrade 3 effect:<math>4^\text{upgradeLevel}</math>
* Magnet upgrade 4 effect:(?)
* Magnet upgrade 5 effect:<math>(\text{upgradeLevel}/1000)%</math>
* Magnet upgrade 6 effect:<math>(\text{upgradeLevel}/1000)%</math>
* Magnet upgrade 7 effect:<math>1+\text{UpgradeLevel}</math>

=== Special Mineral Base Spawn Cost ===

<math>\text{Special Mineral Base Spawn Cost} = 9.98 + \left(\frac{\text{SMS Factor}}{60}\right)^{1.8}</math>

* If [[Elements|Wind Node 2]] has been purchased, the above is then divided by this effect

* If SMS Factor > 7500, where <math>x</math> is the result of the above formula: <math>x^{1+\frac{\text{SMS Factor}-7500}{1000}}</math>

* The final base spawn cost is the ceiling of the result

=== Polish Weapons PP Cost ===
For the formulae below:
* <big><math>\text{Amount } = \text{ Polish Weapon Level}</math></big>
* <big><math>\text{Cups10TC } = \text{ The value of the Ten of Cups Tarot Card's 2nd effect}</math></big>

